      "floor",
      "random",
      "ai"
    ],
    "random_max_margin_over_floor": 0.05,
    "note": "The Forge AI is pinned at 1500. Every other rating has the weak prior N(1500, 400^2) on the Elo scale, so floor and random (which win almost nothing) stay finite; the first-player term has N(0, 1) in logits. floor (always pass) and random (uniform legal option) are sanity anchors: floor <= random < Forge AI must hold in every bootstrap replicate. STR_norm = (WR - WR_random) / (WR_AImirror - WR_random), uncapped."
